#: yonca/templates/terms.html:81
msgid "January 2026"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:83
msgid "Welcome to"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:83
msgid "(the \"Service\", \"Platform\", \"Website\"), operated by"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:83
msgid ""
"(\"we\", \"us\", \"our\"). By accessing or using Yonca, you agree to be "
"bound by these Terms of Service (\"Terms\"). If you do not agree with any"
" part of these Terms, you must not use the Service."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:87
msgid "1. Eligibility"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:89
msgid "You must be at least"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:89
msgid "years old"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:89
msgid ""
"to use Yonca. If you are under the age of 18, you confirm that you have "
"permission from a parent or legal guardian."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:90
msgid "You represent that the information you provide is accurate and complete."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:93
msgid "2. Accounts and Authentication"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:95
msgid "Some features require creating an account."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:96
msgid ""
"You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your login "
"credentials and for all activities that occur under your account."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:97
msgid ""
"You agree not to share your account or use another user's account without"
" permission."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:98
msgid ""
"We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these "
"Terms."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:101
msgid "3. User Content"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:103
msgid "3.1 Content You Provide"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:104
msgid ""
"Yonca may allow you to submit, upload, store, or share content such as "
"text, images, files, or messages (\"User Content\")."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:105
msgid ""
"You retain ownership of your User Content. However, by submitting "
"content, you grant Yonca a"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:105
msgid "non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free license"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:105
msgid ""
"to host, store, process, and display the content solely for operating and"
" improving the Service."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:107
msgid "3.2 Responsibility for Content"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:108
msgid ""
"You are solely responsible for your User Content. You agree not to upload"
" or share content that:"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:110
msgid "Is illegal, fraudulent, or misleading"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:111
msgid "Infringes intellectual property or privacy rights"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:112
msgid "Contains malware, viruses, or harmful code"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:113
msgid "Is abusive, hateful, or harassing"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:115
msgid "We may remove content that violates these Terms or applicable laws."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:117
msgid "4. File Storage and Third-Party Services"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:119
msgid "Yonca may use"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:119
msgid "third-party services"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:119
msgid ""
"(such as cloud storage, APIs, or translation services) to operate "
"features like file uploads, backups, or content processing."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:120
msgid ""
"Your content may be processed or stored through these services strictly "
"for functionality."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:121
msgid ""
"Yonca is not responsible for outages, data loss, or changes caused by "
"third-party providers, to the extent permitted by law."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:124
msgid "4.1 Google Drive Integration"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:126
msgid "Yonca may allow users to connect their"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:126
msgid "account"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:126
msgid ""
"using Google OAuth 2.0 for purposes such as uploading, storing, "
"accessing, or managing files."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:127
msgid "When you connect Google Drive, Yonca accesses only the"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:127
msgid "minimum permissions required"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:127
msgid ""
"to provide the requested functionality, as disclosed during the Google "
"authorization process."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:128
msgid "Yonca"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:128
msgid "does not access, read, or modify"
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:128
msgid "files outside the scope explicitly permitted by you."
msgstr ""

#: yonca/templates/terms.html:129
msgid ""
"Files uploaded or managed via Google Drive remain under your control and "
"subject to"
